    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn your <strong>MIDI keyboard</strong> into a <strong>computer keyboard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use MIDI keyboard to type and play games just like using computer keyboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or turn on [global monitor] to generate music when typing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When your computer is connected to multiple MIDI devices, please select the correct MIDI port for listening. Double click the corresponding device in the [Settings] -&gt;[Commonly used] -&gt;[MIDI port] list to achieve monitoring. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b When some games cannot be mapped, please right-click SMIDIToKey. exe -&gt;to run as an administrator</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn your <strong>MIDI keyboard</strong> into a <strong>computer keyboard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use MIDI keyboard to type and play games just like using computer keyboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or turn on [global monitor] to generate music when typing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When your computer is connected to multiple MIDI devices, please select the correct MIDI port for listening. Double click the corresponding device in the [Settings] -&gt;[Commonly used] -&gt;[MIDI port] list to achieve monitoring. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b When some games cannot be mapped, please right-click SMIDIToKey. exe -&gt;to run as an administrator</p>",
